uirements.\n\n[Data: Sources (9), Date_Range ((2000, 04, 01), (2000, 07, 12))]\"\n        }\n    ],\n    \"date_range\": [\"2000-01-01\", \"2000-07-12\"]\n}\n\n\n# Real Data\n\nUse the following text for your answer. Do not make anything up in your answer.\n\nText:\n-----SOURCES-----\nid,text,entity_degree\n696,\"--- Record 2661 ---\nComponent: Cloud Identity Services\nEnvironment: Cloud Foundry,Kyma,Neo\nTitle: Regional Availability\nDescription: Cloud Identity Services now operates with only two IPs in the data center in Switzerland. See Regional Availability.  Action:  We recommend you to add the following IPs to your allowed IP list:    LB IP - 20.250.104.188, 20.250.104.193  NAT IP - 4.226.38.130/32, 4.226.41.61/32  \nAction: Recommended\nLifecycle: General Availability\nType: Announcement\nLine of Business: Technology\nLatest Revision: 2024-07-02\nValid as Of: 2024-07-02\nVersion: 26327\n\n--- Record 2662 ---\nComponent: Cloud Identity Services\nEnvironment: Cloud Foundry,Kyma,Neo\nTitle: Regular Upgrade\nDescription: Cloud Identity Services have been upgraded.\nAction: Info only\nLifecycle: General Availability\nType: New\nLine of Business: Technology\nLatest Revision: 2024-07-02\nValid as Of: 2024-07-02\nVersion: 26327\n\n--- Record 2663 ---\nComponent: Cloud Identity Services\nEnvironment: Cloud Foundry,Kyma,Neo\nTitle: Security recommendations for SAP Cloud Identity Services - Identity Provisioning\nDescription: Security recommendations for SAP Cloud Identity Services - Identity Provisioning are now available to help you secure its configuration and operation in your landscape.  See Security Information. \nAction: Info only\nLifecycle: General Availability\nType: Announcement\nLine of Business: Technology\nLatest Revision: 2024-07-02\nValid as Of: 2024-07-02\nVersion: 26327\n\n--- Record 2664 ---\nComponent: Cloud Identity Services\nEnvironment: Cloud Foundry,Kyma,Neo\nTitle: skipOperations create is enhanced in SAP Analytics Cloud version 1 target systems